Package: adeshlang
Version: 0.3.0
Section: devel
# arm64 is built identically with: dpkg-deb --build --arch arm64
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28)
Maintainer: AdeshLang Team
Description: AdeshLang compiler, package manager, language server, and editor
